# IMP-09 SR-003 premise check: WebView callback order on a failed main-frame load (design-spec DS-006)
# commit: ba3ba5b23e + TEMPORARY changes, now removed: Log.i("ABX433TMP", …) in AutoByteusWebView.Client
#   (onPageStarted, onPageFinished, onReceivedError, onReceivedHttpError) and an instrumented test
#   TmpLoadOrderProbeTest that creates AutoByteusWebView for each base URL, waits 8 s, calls loadTrusted (a reload), waits 8 s.
# command: ANDROID_SERIAL=emulator-5570 ./gradlew :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.class=org.autobyteus.mobile.TmpLoadOrderProbeTest
#          then: adb -s emulator-5570 logcat -d -v time -s ABX433TMP:I
# env: own emulator codex_api35_arm64 (-read-only, port 5570), Android 15 (API 35), Android System WebView 124.0.6367.219;
#      host test servers on 127.0.0.1 (the emulator's 10.0.2.2): :8434 closed (connection refused), :8433 answers 502 with an HTML body, :8435 answers 200.
# date: 2026-11-08
# runs: 2, same order both times (run 1's log buffer lost its first lines; run 2 below is complete)

