# Result
# - Network failure (:8434, error -6 ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED), first load and reload: onPageStarted -> onReceivedError(main) -> onPageFinished. Matches the premise.
# - HTTP error (:8433, 502), first load and reload: onReceivedHttpError(main) -> onPageStarted -> onPageFinished. DIFFERS from the premise:
#   the HTTP error arrives before onPageStarted, so "onPageStarted clears the failed mark" would erase the failure and
#   onPageFinished would report onPageLoaded() for the 502 page.
# - A sub-resource HTTP error (favicon.ico, main=false) arrives after onPageFinished; not a main-frame outcome.
# - Success (:8435): onPageStarted -> onPageFinished.
